{
  "id": "scrap_tech_workshop:holologs/en/tutorial/scavenging_field_briefing_01",
  "title": "Scavenging Field Briefing 01",
  "subtitle": "Locate and collect usable scrap materials.",
  "color": "#00FF88",
  "lineDelay": 2.8,
  "voiceOver": "scrap_tech_workshop:holologs/en/tutorial/scavenging_field_briefing_01",
  "voiceOverDelay": 2.8,
  "displayHoloEntity": {
    "id": "scrap_tech_workshop:hololog_humanoid",
    "texture": "scrap_tech_workshop:textures/entity/hololog/hololog_humanoid.png",
    "scale": 0.5
  },
  "start": {
    "playSound": [{"id": "minecraft:block.note_block.hat", "volume": 0.8}],
    "showParticle": [{"id": "minecraft:dust", "color": "#00FFAA"}]
  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Connection established.",
      "playSound": [{"id": "minecraft:block.beacon.power_select", "volume": 0.7}]
    },
    {"text": "Scrap is the foundation of every rebuild."},
    {"text": "You can recover it from several sources."},
    {
      "text": "1) Mining blocks and debris.",
      "displayBlock": {"id": "minecraft:stone"},
      "playSound": [{"id": "minecraft:block.stone.break", "volume": 0.5}]
    },
    {"text": "Stone and rubble often yield metal fragments."},
    {
      "text": "2) Natural scrap piles.",
      "displayItem": {"id": "scrap_tech_workshop:mixed_scrap_pile"},
      "playSound": [{"id": "minecraft:block.gravel.place", "volume": 0.4}]
    },
    {"text": "Mixed piles → a little of everything."},
    {
      "text": "Metal piles → alloys and fasteners.",
      "displayItem": {"id": "scrap_tech_workshop:metal_scrap_pile"}
    },
    {
      "text": "Tech piles → circuits, coils, and capacitors.",
      "displayItem": {"id": "scrap_tech_workshop:tech_scrap_pile"}
    },
    {
      "text": "3) Chests and ruins.",
      "displayBlock": {"id": "minecraft:chest"},
      "playSound": [{"id": "minecraft:block.chest.open", "volume": 0.6}]
    },
    {"text": "The rarer the structure, the better the scrap."},
    {
      "text": "Search for coils, capacitors or cell fragments.",
      "displayItem": {"id": "scrap_tech_workshop:capacitor_scrap"}
    },
    {
      "text": "4) Water sources and fishing.",
      "displayItem": {"id": "minecraft:fishing_rod"},
      "playSound": [{"id": "minecraft:entity.fishing_bobber.splash", "volume": 0.5}]
    },
    {
      "text": "Common finds: glass, rubber, and fiber scrap.",
      "displayItem": {"id": "scrap_tech_workshop:glass_scrap"}
    },
    {"text": "Collect first. Refine later."},
    {
      "text": "Craft an Energy Cell from collected fragments.",
      "displayItem": {"id": "scrap_tech_workshop:energy_cell"},
      "playSound": [{"id": "minecraft:block.beacon.activate", "volume": 0.8}]
    },
    {
      "text": "It is the core of all future technology.",
      "displayItem": {"id": "scrap_tech_workshop:energy_cell"}
    },
    {
      "text": "Everything begins with this cell.",
      "displayItem": {"id": "scrap_tech_workshop:energy_cell"}
    },
    {
      "text": "More Holopads are scattered across the world.",
      "displayItem": {"id": "scrap_tech_workshop:holo_pad_engineering_briefing_01"}
    },
    {
      "text": "They contain blueprints and instructions.",
      "displayItem": {"id": "minecraft:writable_book"}
    },
    {
      "text": "Watch for their faint signals while exploring.",
      "playSound": [{"id": "minecraft:block.note_block.chime", "volume": 0.5}]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "playSound": [
      {"id": "minecraft:block.beacon.deactivate", "volume": 0.9},
      {"id": "minecraft:ui.toast.in"}
    ],
    "showParticle": [{"id": "minecraft:flash"}]
  }
}
